---

---

<section class="relative w-full pt-8 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="relative z-20 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center w-full max-w-12xl px-10">
    <div class="lg:w-1/2 lg:sticky lg:top-0 lg:self-start flex flex-col justify-center pb-10 lg:pb-0" style={{ "min-height": "100dvh" }}>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:gap-6">
        <p class="text-foreground-muted font-medium text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl anim-fade-up" style={{ "--anim-delay": "0.1s" }}>Hola, soy</p>

        <div class="flex items-end gap-0 anim-fade-up" style={{ "--anim-delay": "0.25s", "--anim-duration": "0.9s" }}>
          <h1 class="hero-name text-foreground text-left">Frank</h1>
        </div>

        <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-foreground anim-fade-up" style={{ "font-size": "var(--font-h2-display)", "--anim-delay": "0.4s" }}>Frontend Developer & UX/UI Designer</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center gap-6 pt-10 lg:pt-0 pb-16 lg:pb-0 lg:pl-16 xl:pl-24" style={{ "min-height": "100dvh" }}>
      <p class="text-foreground-muted anim-fade-up" style={{ "font-size": "var(--font-h3)", "--anim-delay": "0.5s" }}>Trabajando desde Tarragona, España.</p>

      <p class="max-w-4xl anim-fade-up" style={{ "--anim-delay": "0.6s" }}>
        Diseño y desarrollo experiencias digitales que funcionan. Combino UX/UI, desarrollo frontend, SEO técnico y automatización para crear productos rápidos, accesibles y orientados a resultados.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 anim-fade-up" style={{ "--anim-delay": "0.75s" }}>
        <a
          href="/proyectos"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold px-7 sm:px-9 h-12 sm:h-14 text-sm sm:text-base rounded-full bg-foreground text-[#f0e8dc] hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-200"
        >
          Mis proyectos
        </a>
        <a
          href="/blog"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold px-7 sm:px-9 h-12 sm:h-14 text-sm sm:text-base rounded-full text-foreground bg-background hover:bg-background/80 transition-colors duration-200"
        >
          Blog
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
